UPDATE companies SET description='Rio Puerco Woodworks is based in Rio Rancho, New Mexico.

The company produces custom hand-crafted interior and exterior doors for residential and commercial clients across the Albuquerque, Rio Rancho, and Santa Fe areas. Each door is built to order, with Haring working directly with customers to develop designs that range from traditional panel doors to complex arched entries for circular rooms.

Rio Puerco serves homeowners, builders, and commercial contractors who need one-of-a-kind architectural woodwork. Past projects have included distinctive challenges such as an arched front door for a circular entry room, and the company’s work has been featured in regional newspapers and magazines. Clients typically engage through design consultations at the Rio Rancho workshop.

