UPDATE companies SET description='Royal Metals Co. has operated as a locally owned, family-run metal distributor and service center in Honolulu, Hawaii, since 1983. The company serves all Hawaiian Islands and the broader Pacific region from its Oahu base.

Beyond distribution, it provides cutting and fabrication services, maintains a large local inventory, and runs daily delivery routes across Oahu with regular shipments to the outer islands. Non-stock items are sourced mill-direct with short lead times from the mainland.

Customers include fabricators, welders, HVAC and roofing contractors, marine and boating professionals, all military bases in the islands, and the general public. The company positions itself as a one-stop metal source for both trade and retail buyers throughout the Pacific.

