UPDATE companies SET description='The Lima campus houses corporate offices, a main pellet production facility, and a packaging plant. The company extended its footprint to the Southeast in 1994 with a 38,000-square-foot facility in Lawrenceville, Georgia, and to the Southwest in 2003 with a packaging operation in Dallas, Texas capable of 15 million pounds annually. Rudolph Foods acquired Whitefeather Foods, a Wapakoneta, Ohio pork rind maker founded in 1984, in 2000, and later added Lee''s Pig Skins in New Hebron, Mississippi.

