UPDATE companies SET description='SPAL USA, the North American subsidiary of Italy''s SPAL Automotive Srl, has operated from Ankeny, Iowa since 1989. The company runs a 40,000-square-foot sales and distribution center that supplies cooling components and customized systems to OEM and aftermarket customers across the continent.

The facility stocks and supports a full line of thermal-management products manufactured by its parent company: brushed and brushless axial fans, brushed and brushless centrifugal blowers, and brushless coolant pumps. SPAL USA adds value by configuring these building blocks into application-specific cooling packages for vehicles and stationary equipment.

The customer base spans on- and off-highway markets. In the automotive sector, SPAL USA serves car, bus and coach, powersport, and truck OEMs. It also supplies agriculture and construction machinery builders, mobile refrigeration units, oil-cooling systems, and a range of stationary industrial applications. Both original equipment manufacturers and aftermarket distributors rely on the Ankeny center for technical support and rapid fulfillment.

SPAL Automotive Srl brings more than 60 years of design and production experience to the partnership. The group''s stated mission is to deliver the highest-quality cooling products through continuous R&D investment and tight control over every manufacturing step. That heritage, combined with local inventory and engineering support, is what SPAL USA presents as its differentiator in the North American market.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Sales and distribution of axial fans, centrifugal blowers, and coolant pumps", "Custom cooling system design and integration", "OEM thermal management engineering support", "Aftermarket technical service and fulfillment", "Brushless motor application engineering", "IP68/IP6K9K sealed motor integration", "Smart control integration (PWM, CAN, LIN)"], "industries": ["Automotive (car, bus & coach, powersport, truck)", "Agriculture", "Construction equipment", "Mobile refrigeration", "Oil cooling", "Stationary industrial applications"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["North American inventory and engineering support since 1989", "Parent company with 60+ years of cooling-system design and manufacturing", "IP68/IP6K9K sealed brushless motors with integrated EMC protection", "Customized cooling packages for OEM and aftermarket applications"], "facts_used": ["SPAL USA is the North American subsidiary of SPAL Automotive Srl -> db", "has been supplying products from Italy since 1989 -> db", "sales and distribution center is currently located in a 40,000-square-foot facility in Ankeny, Iowa -> db", "provides customized systems, components and service for OEM and aftermarket applications -> db", "SPAL has been leading the way in the design, production, and sale of innovative heating and cooling system products for the automotive industry and stationary applications for over 60 years -> /", "offers a wide range of products, including axial fans and cen