UPDATE companies SET description='SSI Packaging Group, operating as SSI Packaging powered by Atlantic Tape & Packaging, has been based in Richmond, Virginia since its founding in 1967. The company is locally owned and operated, serving the Mid-Atlantic and Southeast regions from its headquarters on Brook Road.

The business distributes a broad line of packaging and shipping supplies — over 20,000 items including corrugated boxes, packing tape, bubble wrap, kraft paper, void fill, poly bags, and stretch film — all stocked for same-day shipment or warehouse pickup. It also supplies marking and coding equipment such as small-character and large-character drop-on-demand inkjet printers, high-resolution inkjet printers, industrial labeling systems, and stenciling equipment, along with rental programs for coding hardware.

Customers span dozens of sectors, with the company citing food packaging and e-commerce fulfillment as primary examples. Its territory covers Virginia, Maryland, North Carolina, South Carolina, and Georgia, supporting manufacturers, distributors, and fulfillment centers that need reliable packaging and product identification solutions.

SSI emphasizes a value proposition built on five decades of experience, a ''right product for the right solution'' consulting approach, and round-the-clock technical support from both office and field teams. The firm says its differentiators are deep product knowledge, 24/7 service availability, and a commitment to keeping customers'' production lines running.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Packaging supplies distribution", "Marking and coding equipment distribution", "Equipment rental programs", "Technical support and field service", "Warehouse pickup", "Inkjet printer supply", "Industrial labeling systems", "Stenciling equipment supply"], "industries": ["Food packaging", "E-commerce fulfillment"], "materials": ["Corrugated cardboard", "Packing tape", "Bubble wrap", "Kraft paper", "Void fill", "Poly bags", "Stretch film"], "equipment": ["Small Character Inkjet Printers", "Large Character Drop on Demand (DOD) Inkjet Printers", "High-Resolution inkjet printers", "Industrial Labeling systems", "Stenciling equipment", "Rental Systems"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Over 50 years in business", "Superb customer service from office and field teams", "24/7 technical support availability", "Right product for the right solution consulting", "Representing top brands in packaging and coding"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1967 -> db", "Headquarters Richmond, VA -> db", "Locally owned and operated -> /about-us", "Distributor of packaging and marking/coding solutions -> /about-us", "Over 20,000 shipping and packaging items in stock -> /", "Warehouse at 1514 Brook Road Richmond, VA 23220 -> /", "Industries: food packaging, e-commerce fulfillment -> /about-us", "Equipment lines: Small Character Inkjet Printers, Large Character DOD Inkjet Printers, High-Resolution inkjet printers, Industrial Labeling, Stenciling, Rental Systems -> /", "Materials: corrugated boxes, packing tape, bubble wrap, kraft paper, void fill, poly bag