UPDATE companies SET description='Sandia Mountain Solar was established in September 2017 in Sandia Park, New Mexico, as a division of Morgan''s Constructive Solutions, LLC, a general construction firm. The solar division emerged from the parent company''s construction experience, applying that background to the design and installation of photovoltaic systems.

