Sandia Mountain Solar serves residential homeowners and commercial property owners across central New Mexico, including Sandia Park, Cedar Crest, Moriarty, Tijeras, Algodones, Bernalillo, and Edgewood. The company also works with property owners who lack utility access or require backup power during grid outages.

