UPDATE companies SET description='Santee Wire Products Inc was founded in 1983 by T.D. Powell in Holly Hill, South Carolina. Powell began his career at Andrews Wire/Georgetown Steel in 1970 and later moved to Beaumont, Texas, where Georgetown Steel built a plant. In 1983 he returned to South Carolina to start his own venture, establishing the company with straight and cut machines. The business remains family owned and operated.

