UPDATE companies SET description='Sarica Manufacturing Co operates from Urbana, Ohio, as a woman-owned small business (WOSB) providing electronic manufacturing services. The company serves commercial aerospace, Department of Defense, and medical markets with a global footprint spanning North America, Europe, and the Middle East.

