UPDATE companies SET description='Savory Concepts LLC, doing business as Quality Foods, has operated from Bristol, Connecticut since 1991. The company is led by President Peter Graziano and Administrative Vice President Michele Graziano, a principal of the firm, who oversee a commissary that designs menus, develops recipes, and manages food production for workplace refreshment programs across Connecticut, Massachusetts, and Rhode Island.

